  <CHANGES><![CDATA[
### 2026.07.30
- Initial public release.
- Added configurable Docker state, Docker health, ping, TCP, HTTP, and HTTPS checks.
- Added dependency-aware start and stop ordering, restart limits, cooldown, and quarantine protection.
- Added explicit per-container and global save controls.
- Added safe manual checks and clean Plugin Manager removal.
  ]]></CHANGES>

